"><span>Riu Montego Bay, Jamaica - Feb 28, 2009<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/an1cERQ0g410800NTQxNzJvfDQ3NDI5NmxhfE91ciBXZWRkaW5nIGluIEphbWFpY2EgaXMgaW4.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/an1cERQ0g4108...2EgaXMgaW4.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kris@lilpaisley.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1203912600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208641.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":79,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilpaisley","Id":208641,"Name":"Lilpaisley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d1db1a425701b175c80f27b2cf0466f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Lilpaisley&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I might be interested in this stuff for our AHR. (everything, but the dress). Let me know how much shipping would be and I can Paypal it to you.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Sweet! I have to find a box that will fit it. I also have a pillow (for a ring bearer) that matches the guest book. Want me to throw that in? And I found some little white favor heart boxes that you could put candy in. They are Martha Stewart brand. Here is a link to them. I think that there are like 20 or so. Let me know if you want those too. \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.walmart.com\/catalog\/product.do?product_id=10097953&amp;amp;sourceid=1500000000000003260360&amp;amp;ci_src=14110944&amp;amp;ci_sku=10097953\"&gt;Walmart.com: Martha Stewart Eyelet-Pattern Heart-Shaped Party Favor Tins, Set of 20: Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Are you sure you don&#039;t want the dress!!?? JK i really hate the thing! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile105\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":465325,"PostDate":1222642182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Lilpaisley<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I might be interested in this stuff for our AHR. (everything, but the dress). Let me know how much shipping would be and I can Paypal it to you.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Sweet! I have to find a box that will fit it. I also have a pillow (for a ring bearer) that matches the guest book. Want me to throw that in? And I found some little white favor heart boxes that you could put candy in. They are Martha Stewart brand. Here is a link to them. I think that there are like 20 or so. Let me know if you want those too. <br \