             }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>dmarie17<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">And last but not least, this never worn dress. I was going to do a TTD but was too tired! I'd like to sell it so if anyone likes it and wants to make me an offer, I'll get rid of it cheap!! I think that it's a size 8 (I'm a size 4 normally if that helps)<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i105.photobucket.com\/albums\/m211\/dmarie17\/Unknown-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Congrats Newlywed!<br \/> <br \/> I am considering wearing another dress for our TTD photo shoot. Cost and fit depending.<br \/> <br \/> How much are you willing to part with the dress for? <br \/> <br \/> Approximate shipping cost to Niagara Falls, Ontario, Canada?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks<br \/> Laura\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura.lynn.hale@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1213210181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/c\/cb\/cb051bff_user-6060-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HaleGrifa","Id":209898,"Name":"HaleGrifa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae9200e66962fd29300d85a7b44efff3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;dmarie17&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Sweet! I have to find a box that will fit it. I also have a pillow (for a ring bearer) that matches the guest book. Want me to throw that in? And I found some little white favor heart boxes that you could put candy in. They are Martha Stewart brand. Here is a link to them. I think that there are like 20 or so. Let me know if you want those too. \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.walmart.com\/catalog\/product.do?product_id=10097953&amp;amp;sourceid=1500000000000003260360&amp;amp;ci_src=14110944&amp;amp;ci_sku=10097953\"&gt;Walmart.com: Martha Stewart Eyelet-Pattern Heart-Shaped Party Favor Tins, Set of 20: Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Are you sure you don&#039;t want the dress!!?? JK i really hate the thing! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile105\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n Hi - it is Laura again . . . \n \n looks like you hate this dress - how much do you hate it $$$ lol\n \n Let me know - Thank you\n LH","Attachments":[],"Id":467227,"PostDate":1222785677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>dmarie17<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Sweet! I have to find a box that will fit it. I also have a pillow (for a ring bearer) that matches the guest book. Want me to throw that in? And I found some little white favor heart boxes that you could put candy in. They are Martha Stewart brand. Here is a link to them. I think that there are like 20 or so. Let me know if you want those too. <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.walmart.com\/catalog\/product.do?product_id=10097953&sourceid=1500000000000003260360&ci_src=14110944&ci_sku=10097953' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Walmart.com: Martha Stewart Eyelet-Pattern Heart-Shaped Party Favor Tins, Set of 20: Wedding<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Are you sure you don't want the dress!!?? JK i really hate the thing! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile105\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> Hi - it is Laura again . . . <br \/> <br \/> looks like you hate this dress - how much do you hate it $$$ lol<br \/> <br \/> Let me know - Thank you<br \/> LH\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura.lynn.hale@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1213210181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/c\/cb\/cb051bff_user-6060-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HaleGrifa","Id":209898,"Name":"HaleGrifa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca71fe52cdbedafd6462d4b363af9120","RawContent":"Okay, my stupid computer is acting up so I can&#039;t quote anything right now but i&#039;ll try to answer everything. Lilpaisley is taking some of the stuff. \n JLwhite, I just PM&#039;d you to see what you are interested in. \n Latinalocany, I will let you know what is available after I hear from JLwhite.\n Vtello, they are right now but i am waiting to hear from JLwhite. \n Minde, the lanterns are gone. Sorry.\n HaleGrifa, I don&#039;t know why I hate the dress so much. It&#039;s actually really pretty... just not &#039;me&#039;. Y&#039;know? Anyway, I bought it for $150 and would love to get that but I&#039;d settle for less just to get rid of it... I don&#039;t have a clue how much shipping would be. It&#039;s not very heavy so it can&#039;t be THAT bad, right?!","Attachments":[],"Id":468017,"PostDate":1222822978,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Okay, my stupid computer is acting up so I can't quote anything right now but i'll try to answer everything. Lilpaisley is taking some of the stuff. <br \/> JLwhite, I just PM'd you to see what you are interested in. <br \/> Latinalocany, I will let you know what is available after I hear from JLwhite.<br \/> Vtello, they are right now but i am waiting to hear from JLwhite. <br \/> Minde, the lanterns are gone. Sorry.<br \/> HaleGrifa, I don't know why I hate the dress so much. It's actually really pretty... just not 'me'. Y'know? Anyway, I bought it for $150 and would love to get that but I'd settle for less just to get rid of it... I don't have a clue how much shipping would be. It's not very heavy so it can't be THAT bad, right?!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;103\/st\/20080831\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ebb5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ebb5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dmdrapala@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1201552313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208393.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":166,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dmarie17","Id":208393,"Name":"dmarie17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6feac646272410463bbc60625c9cae51","RawContent":"Hey if there&#039;s ANYTHING left, please PM me with the list. I&#039;d take just about anything!! Haha!!","Attachments":[],"Id":468307,"PostDate":1222844733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey if there's ANYTHING left, please PM me with the list. I'd take just about anything!! Haha!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"oo0ehxtahcee0oo@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1222144751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211893.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":69,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"trophywife","Id":211893,"Name":"trophywife","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24375,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de734a432f61a74fe4df24cc28cb6aa9","RawContent":"[QUOTE=dmarie17;557114]Okay, my stupid computer is acting up so I can&#039;t quote anything right now but i&#039;ll try to answer everything. Lilpaisley is taking some of the stuff. \n JLwhite, I just PM&#039;d you to see what you are interested in. \n Latinalocany, I will let you know what is available after I hear from JLwhite.\n Vtello, they are right now but i am waiting to hear from JLwhite. \n Minde, the lanterns are gone. Sorry.\n HaleGrifa, I don&#039;t know why I hate the dress so much. It&#039;s actually really pretty... just not &#039;me&#039;. Y&#039;know? Anyway, I bought it for $150 and would love to get that but I&#039;d settle for less just to get rid of it... I don&#039;t have a clue how much shipping would be. It&#039;s not very heavy so it can&#039;t be THAT bad, right?![\/QUOT\n \n Thanks so much for getting back to me!\n \n I have decided not to go ahead with the dress - as I have found a cotton eyelit dress that will work and not be as heavy.\n \n Sorry that I could not help you off load it.\n \n Laura","Attachments":[],"Id":468672,"PostDate":1222880630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                [QUOTE=dmarie17;557114]Okay, my stupid computer is acting up so I can't quote anything right now but i'll try to answer everything. Lilpaisley is taking some of the stuff. <br \/> JLwhite, I just PM'd you to see what you are interested in. <br \/> Latinalocany, I will let you know what is available after I hear from JLwhite.<br \/> Vtello, they are right now but i am waiting to hear from JLwhite. <br \/> Minde, the lanterns are gone. Sorry.<br \/> HaleGrifa, I don't know why I hate the dress so much. It's actually really pretty... just not 'me'. Y'know? Anyway, I bought it for $150 and would love to get that but I'd settle for less just to get rid of it... I don't have a clue how much shipping would be. It's not very heavy so it can't be THAT bad, right?![\/QUOT<br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much for getting back to me!<br \/> <br \/> I have decided not to go ahead with the dress - as I have found a cotton eyelit dress that will work and not be as heavy.<br \/> <br \/> Sorry that I could not help you off load it.<br \/> <br \/> Laura\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laura.lynn.hale@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1213210181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoU